    <string name="tpl_todo_body"># To-do list\n\n{date}\n\n## Today\n- [ ] \n- [ ] \n- [ ] \n\n## This week\n- [ ] \n- [ ] \n\n## Done\n- [x] Create my first list\n</string>
    <string name="tpl_meeting_body"># Meeting notes\n\n{date}\n\n**Topic:** \n**Attendees:** \n\n## Agenda\n1. \n2. \n3. \n\n## Notes\n\n## Decisions\n\n## Action items\n- [ ] Who: what (due date)\n</string>
    <string name="tpl_journal_body"># Daily journal\n\n{date}\n\n## How do I feel?\n\n## Three good things\n1. \n2. \n3. \n\n## What I learned today\n\n## Tomorrow I will\n- [ ] \n</string>
    <string name="tpl_shopping_body"># Shopping list\n\n{date}\n\n## Fruit and vegetables\n- [ ] \n\n## Dairy and bakery\n- [ ] \n\n## Meat and fish\n- [ ] \n\n## Household\n- [ ] \n</string>
    <string name="tpl_weekly_body"># Weekly plan\n\nWeek of {date}\n\n## Goals\n- [ ] \n- [ ] \n\n## Monday\n- [ ] \n\n## Tuesday\n- [ ] \n\n## Wednesday\n- [ ] \n\n## Thursday\n- [ ] \n\n## Friday\n- [ ] \n\n## Weekend\n- [ ] \n</string>
    <string name="tpl_project_body"># Project brief\n\n{date}\n\n## Goal\n\n## Scope\n- \n\n## Milestones\n| Milestone | Date | Owner |\n|---|---|---|\n| | | |\n\n## Risks\n- \n\n## Next steps\n- [ ] \n</string>
    <string name="tpl_book_body"># Book notes\n\n**Title:** \n**Author:** \n**Started:** {date}\n\n## Summary\n\n## Key ideas\n- \n- \n\n## Favorite quotes\n&gt; \n\n## My rating\n/5\n</string>
    <string name="tpl_recipe_body"># Recipe\n\n**Serves:** \n**Time:** \n\n## Ingredients\n- \n- \n- \n\n## Steps\n1. \n2. \n3. \n\n## Notes\n</string>
